;The P5 USB Glove is recognized as a mouse device under OS X, but not under
;OS 9. I've included the USB Prober report in case anyone can see anything in
;the report that looks suspect:
;
;
;96 (0x60): Composite device (Demo P5  USB)
;    Device Descriptor
;        Descriptor Version Number:. 0x0110
;        Device Class:.............. 0   (Composite)
;        Device Subclass:........... 0
